--[[
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    DRIFTGOD v1.0.3 - Product Build
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    lightweight arcade-based drift system for cherax, fully compatible with standard,
    premium, and prime while preserving DriftGod's scoring, progression, stunts,
    garage, ghost, race, tuning, and arcade gameplay systems.

    description:
    - adds arcade drift scoring, stunt chains, rivals, rewards, presets, and huds
    - saves progress, settings, recordings, presets, and generated assets under cherax\lua\driftgod
    - restores the active drift preset on load so drifting works immediately
    - includes prime-safe garage loading with exact saved vehicles, restored mods, and flashless reveal
    - includes Power Glider beta with camera-guided low-grip momentum, presets, and optional Shift counter-steer
    - keeps gameplay logic local to the script with quiet startup behavior and one-file distribution

    controls:
    - home opens the stunt hud by default
    - insert opens the garage hud by default
    - z shows the points hud when enabled
    - delete backs out or closes keyboard hud menus
    - enter selects, spawns, opens, or runs the highlighted hud item
    - left/right arrows switch hud pages, tabs, or selected values where supported
    - up/down arrows move through hud items
    - f5 scans garage vehicle files from the garage hud
    - f9 loads a random saved garage vehicle by default
    - left shift activates Power Glider drift assistance when the selected preset supports counter-steer
    - hud hotkeys, positions, scale, and visibility are adjustable from settings

    notes:
    - run this script on startup for the cleanest asset and progress loading
    - normal logs stay quiet; warnings and errors remain available
    - user settings, protected config files, recordings, and presets are stored locally
    - stunt combos only count when the vehicle starts the stunt at 20 mph or higher
    - Power Glider defaults to the approved Pure Camera profile with 1.20 brake response
    - my first major public project

    changelog:
    - v1.0.3 - prime garage and Power Glider update: exact selected saved-vehicle spawning, Cherax saved-index normalization, correct saved mods and colors, flashless garage reveal, polished Guide/Config/Credits pages, safe deferred settings reset, Power Glider camera-guided ground sliding, five built-in presets plus Custom, and optional Left Shift counter-steer.
    - v1.0.2 - acceleration and tuning update: improved low-speed Acceleration Assist and Experimental Acceleration, strengthened Base Tuning response, and automatic Tuning activation when a Base Tuning method or saved profile is selected.
    - v1.0.1 - prime compatibility update: prime-safe feature, file, garage, ptfx, reload, and unload handling; recursive garage scanning; exact subfolder mapping; configurable garage/random hotkeys; and broad performance and ui stability fixes.
    - v1.0.0 - product build: public release header, driftgod runtime naming, styled progression rewards, safe hud hotkeys, protected config foundation, and quiet startup behavior.
    - v0.9.0 - production cleanup and one-file packaging.
    - v0.8.0 - rewards, unlocks, tuning tiers, and transitions.
    - v0.7.0 - stunts, animation transitions, and cooldown systems.
    - v0.6.0 - garage and keyboard-driven hud systems.
